1
00:00:06,770 --> 00:00:08,870
(Howard:)Did you hear about the
accident at the bio lab?

2
00:00:08,970 --> 00:00:09,880
(Leonard:)No.
What happened?

3
00:00:09,970 --> 00:00:12,770
(Howard:)They were injecting rats
with radioactive isotopes

4
00:00:12,770 --> 00:00:14,710
(Howard:)and one of the techs got bit.

5
00:00:14,710 --> 00:00:17,210
(Raj:)Did he get superpowers?

6
00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:22,750
(Howard:)No, he got five stitches
and a tetanus shot.

7
00:00:22,750 --> 00:00:25,550
(Raj:)Oh. Well, that's disappointing.

8
00:00:25,550 --> 00:00:27,120
(Howard:)Why?

9
00:00:27,120 --> 00:00:29,190
(Raj:)Well, you get bit by a
radioactive animal in a lab,

10
00:00:29,190 --> 00:00:31,820
(Raj:)you kind of want to turn
into a superhero.

11
00:00:31,830 --> 00:00:35,030
(Howard:)Yeah, but who'd want
to become Rat-Man?

12
00:00:35,030 --> 00:00:37,330
(Raj:)Who wouldn't?

13
00:00:37,330 --> 00:00:40,870
(Raj:)You could zip through
a maze in nothing flat,

14
00:00:40,870 --> 00:00:42,700
(Raj:)squeeze through
really small holes,

15
00:00:42,700 --> 00:00:45,740
(Raj:)and shut down restaurants
in a single bound.

16
00:00:45,740 --> 00:00:47,810
(Raj:)And the best part is,
if I were Rat-Man,

17
00:00:47,810 --> 00:00:50,080
(Raj:)you could be my
sidekick, Mouse Boy.

18
00:00:55,220 --> 00:00:56,780
(Howard:)Mouse Boy?

19
00:00:56,780 --> 00:00:58,220
You don't like "Mouse Boy"?

20
00:00:58,220 --> 00:01:00,320
How about "Kid Vermin"?

21
00:01:00,320 --> 00:01:02,290
(Howard:)First of all,
if we had superpowers,

